{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>and it will not succeed.</b> By way of the plain sense (peshat): this ascent to the top of the mountain will not succeed." "<b>And by way of</b> the Kabbalah: the word והוא (\"and it\") refers back to ״פי ה׳״ (\"the mouth of HaShem\"). And the fact that it is written והוא yet read (וקרי) והיא alludes to the active principle (פועל) and the receptive principle (מקבל)." "<b>And Ramban, of blessed memory, wrote:</b> ״והיא לא תצלח״ — by way of truth (emet), as in (Ezekiel 1:13): ״והיא מתהלכת בין החיות״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {2 "The printed text begins וכתב הרמב״ן ז״ל with no bold lemma tag; the word וכתב has been rendered as part of the lemma head. 'Way of truth' (דרך האמת) is Ramban's own term for the kabbalistic path; retained as he cites it."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:32:34.818360812Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}